# Competency question: is a gmeow:DocEvidence node a claim held together WITH its
# grounds? Every evidence node carries at least one gmeow:docGroundedBy carrier
# truthmaker — an ungrounded node would be the doc-layer analogue of a DARK finding.
# The ASK witnesses that the scene demonstrates a grounded evidence node. Asserted
# lane; the gmeow:cqDataFile overlay supplies the self-describing scene.

PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>

ASK {
    ?evidence a gmeow:DocEvidence ;
        gmeow:docEvidenceKind ?kind ;
        gmeow:docGroundedBy ?truthmaker .
}
